    add(11,r'''Note that unlike Theorems 3.1 and 3.2, Theorem 3.3 actually does require the use of the cross-fit AIPW estimator $\widehat\psi_t^\times$ and would not capture $\widetilde\psi_t$ if the sample-split version were used in its place.''',[22],'Original distinction between the full cross-fit and single evaluation-fold estimator for moving effects. Do not replace the two-fold estimator with a more convenient single-fold estimate.',['D21','D25'])
