    issue('asympcs-versus-coverage',[6,13],'Definition2.1 is almost-sure relative-width approximation to an existing valid CS with the same center. Definition2.7 instead describes limiting all-future coverage as the starting index m increases. Neither definition is substituted for the other; T2.8 additionally proves an ordinary limit equality. Separate marginal-in-time coverage is insufficient.')
